---
<footer>
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <p class="footer-phrase r-up">
      Haz cosas que<br />valga la pena <em>contar.</em>
    </p>
    <div class="footer-right r-up d2">
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="mailto:hola@tunombre.com">Email</a>
        <a href="https://twitter.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Twitter</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://linkedin.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
      </div>
      <p class="footer-copy">© 2026 Miguel del Angel Queb Silva · Campeche, México</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-block: 64px; position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .footer-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: 36px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; }
  .footer-phrase { font-family: var(--font-d); font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.02em; line-height: 1.15; max-width: 480px; }
  .footer-phrase em { color: var(--green); font-style: normal; }
  .footer-right { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; gap: 16px; }
  .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 22px; }
  .footer-links a { font-family: var(--font-d); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-3); transition: color .2s; }
  .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
  .footer-copy { font-size: .68rem; color: var(--ink-3); background: var(--grad-ink); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; }
  @media (max-width: 768px) { .footer-inner { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 32px; padding-inline: 20px; } .footer-right { align-items: flex-start; } }
</style>
